ection, and update docs to describe the workflow.\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 19 out of 21 changed files in this pull request and generated 4 comments.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Show a summary per file</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/setup.go | Computes module roots for build packages and passes them into matching/rule loading; refactors runtime generation. |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/setup_test.go | Updates tests to use `pkgload.CommandLineArgumentsPackage`; removes local `getPackageDir` test. |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/match.go | Adds tool-file based rule loading and submodule-skipping rule discovery. |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/match_test.go | Updates match tests for new `loadRules(ctx, moduleDirs)` signature; adds tool-file rule loading tests. |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/config.go | New tool-file discovery and recursive instrumentation walking/resolution. |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/config_test.go | New unit tests covering tool-file selection, resolution, and recursive walking behavior. |\r\n| tool/internal/pkgload/pkgload.go | Adds `CommandLineArgumentsPackage`, `GetPackageDir`, and `FindModuleDirs` helper. |\r\n| tool/internal/pkgload/pkgload_test.go | Adds tests for `GetPackageDir` and `FindModuleDirs`; adjusts resolve-module-dir test. |\r\n| test/integration/instrumentation_selection_test.go | New integration test asserting explicit instrumentation selection overrides defaults. |\r\n| test/apps/gincustom/otel.instrumentation.go | Tool file enabling only the custom gin instrumentation module for the test app. |\r\n| test/apps/gincustom/main.go | New Gin-based test application used by the integration test. |\r\n| test/apps/gincustom/instrumentation/otelc.yaml | Custom instrumentation rule targeting `gin.New`. |\r\n| test/apps/gincustom/instrumentation/otel.instrumentation.go | Tool file composing `net/http/server` into the custom instrumentation module. |\r\n| test/apps/gincustom/instrumentation/hook.go | Hook implementation adding a custom span attribute. |\r\n| test/apps/gincustom/instrumentation/go.mod | New module for the custom instrumentation package (with local replaces). |\r\n| test/apps/gincustom/instrumentation/go.sum | Dependency lockfile for the custom instrumentation module. |\r\n| test/apps/gincustom/go.mod | New module for the `gincustom` app (with local replaces). |\r\n| test/apps/gincustom/go.sum | Dependency lockfile for the `gincustom` app. |\r\n| docs/ux-design.md | Updates UX design to emphasize tool-file based configuration and multi-module behavior. |\r\n| docs/rules.md | Documents rule loading and precedence across sources. |\r\n| docs/getting-started.md | Adds getting-started guidance for `otel.instrumentation.go` / `otelc.tool.go` usage. |\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/new/main?filename=.github/instructions/*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/pull/612#pullrequestreview-4616683242","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/pulls/612","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/pull/612#pullrequestreview-4616683242"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/pulls/612"}},"submitted_at":"2026-07-02T10:37:18Z","commit_id":"8f9d5082210abf7787554e643c5d04e13af03dd5"},{"id":4618547113,"node_id":